BooksAPIInvoiceCustomer.description:
The customer an invoice is billed to. The id is a Mercury Invoicing
customer id, the one the Invoicing customers API (`/ar/customers`) returns;
the name is inlined so a caller needs no second lookup.

referenceNumber.description:
Human-readable reference number (e.g. the vendor's bill number). Optional;
an omitted, null, empty, or whitespace-only value is treated as absent, and
leading and trailing whitespace is stripped.
